{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "c9382225be0e3ece5ec4fe9cc2309dd03c00ff9ddf0d4475e5683d9a117cc735", "ja": "わぁ……！　動くとスカートが綺麗になびいて……。\nリボンも可愛いな。ふふっ。", "zh": "哇……！一动起来裙摆就飘得好漂亮……\n蝴蝶结也好可爱啊。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ab846b1d2a63c1effc2da687206563ccc6f738165208738e046237ef7de0d098", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。その様子だと、\nどうやら気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。看你的样子，\n看来你似乎很喜欢这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "e5fd4615e1ff149311803e448e5f97493e367b51153a5205222dbf7dd7912ec3", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\n素敵な衣装を用意してくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n谢谢您为我准备了这么棒的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "8140c416ef0db689f038c5e301e434f6fa4dc0b38ba683df1b515849f6797036", "ja": "色々な工夫がされてて、とっても可愛いです！\n早くステージに立ちたくなりました。", "zh": "融入了各种巧妙设计，真的特别可爱！\n让我都想快点站上舞台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "26f8bcc59f3e91393bfb0b45b9628c4711baeacc5de5691c98f2c28377335169", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、嬉しいよ。\n衣装は、着てみないとわからないことも多いからな。", "zh": "你能这么说，我很高兴。\n服装这种东西，很多地方不试穿一下是不会知道的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "9e5463556d7f32f79f31d915bb3d464de885fd2964493b3a80b2c7a53bb20517", "ja": "はい。実は{$P$}が来る前に、\nちょっとだけ体を動かしてみたんです。", "zh": "是的。其实在{$P$}来之前，我稍微活动了一下身体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "275866f932fd78a8031c70496698f5eeeb820ff222c6b73dac60d37c27d5265e", "ja": "どんなに動いても、シルエットが崩れなくて……\n私、感動しちゃいました！", "zh": "无论怎么活动，剪影都没有变形……\n我真的好感动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d054912e91cb9809b211a476c6264687efda8854c52f1e41ecd61663d7e2c85b", "ja": "ははっ。アイドルが着る衣装だからな。\nある程度の動きには耐えられるように作られてるんだ。", "zh": "哈哈。毕竟是偶像要穿的服装嘛。\n当然要做成能承受一定程度活动的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "788be3e451af4c92496962126be4eb82b956b4b656c8c51d6c6e35a4b9861305", "ja": "そうなんですね！　衣装に込められたこだわりも、\nファンのみんなに届けてあげたいな……。", "zh": "原来如此！既然是偶像穿的服装，里面的用心也想传达给粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "b9fadfc8ae2a20175b5fe58c1ce075d7a7a98a5ee65dfb21f12e242f8bc94c49", "ja": "やっぱり、ステージに立つしかないですね！\nそれが私にできる、一番の恩返しだと思いますから。", "zh": "果然，还是只能站上舞台了呢！\n因为我觉得，那是最好的报恩方式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4a8322a557e10f5004b65b3220814d7f23e26ad9d1ad9053e5246efed52153a5", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！　ブログを見た人たちも、\n紗代子のステージが早く見たいって思ってるよ。", "zh": "啊，说得没错！看过博客的人们，也都想早点看到紗代子的舞台表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "2ab6ebc088e68ce5add79b6fa0fa8c0ae605644ecec5d7efce707d06de6e1950", "ja": "はい！　せっかくですし……いつもより大胆に、\nステージ全体を使った公演とかどうですか？", "zh": "好的！难得有这个机会……要不要来一场比平时更大胆、充分利用整个舞台的演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "6e73983479ddfba451aade5adc78aa7c0e42cde02000abc58c06582e0c7409a8", "ja": "そうすれば、たくさんの人に見てもらえますよね！\n私、ステージの端から端まで走りますよ！", "zh": "这样一来，就能让更多人看到我们了！\n我会从舞台这头一直跑到那头哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d4e4b7edd6a30b2f928632c5f8fc132c03c3048c8174ee06fcf3e910ff0a0bf6", "ja": "走るのは危ないから、別の機会にするとして……。\nステージ全体を使った公演は面白そうだな！", "zh": "在舞台上跑来跑去太危险了，还是改天再做吧……\n利用整个舞台来演出，听起来很有意思啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "91f38dfefe65e7d12a2f9c9a5150be78f256bc73ba466a4bee28d7bfeeb8ecd1", "ja": "本当ですか！　会場にいる人たち全員に、\nパフォーマンスを届けるなら、それしかないと思って。", "zh": "真的吗！我觉得如果要把表演传达给会场里的所有人，就只能这么做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "58d8768fc897b2aedacb77ad13a6957613fe8e1becabdfd2acd48b5d9dd42f19", "ja": "なるほどな。でも、そうなると結構体力を使うから、\nレッスンも大変になりそうだな……。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，这样一来会相当消耗体力，训练也会变得很辛苦吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "54d1a4fb03ebd83915deb6b768dbb781c7cb094be694fef894c79777aede2daa", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}！　最後まで\nやりきった先に、鮮やかな景色が待ってますから！", "zh": "没问题的，{$P$}！只要坚持\n做到最后，前方一定会有绚丽的景色在等着我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "652d40a36d9bc908fff609deed5ae403c770ab8b048c2245c02199676ccfe20f", "ja": "でも、もう少し体力作りをしておいた方がいいかも。\nあの、この後の打ち合わせって2時間後ですよね？", "zh": "不过，或许还是应该再锻炼一下体力。\n那个，接下来的商谈是2小时后，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "32056d211429b05fe1b59142ea0b9de7d8647d06fe31095cef9065fa1e3d429c", "ja": "ああ、テレビ番組の打ち合わせだよな？\n確かに、2時間後だけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，是电视节目的商谈吧？\n确实是2小时后……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "54d5828b159195db4895c079856fc4a650059ffa62cc2457523cd5c115544cda", "ja": "それなら十分、アイドルの特訓……\nいえ、猛特訓ができますね！", "zh": "那样的话，完全可以进行偶像特训……\n不，是魔鬼特训了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5f031df2411d79f229d156261960867dfbe7e6ccb777a047b84cd18aa0b5736f", "ja": "アイドルの特訓って……まさか！？\n今から体力作りするつもりじゃ……！", "zh": "偶像特训……难道说！？\n你该不会打算现在开始锻炼体力吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "6de1a531c7c3487a65a3d055447e93fda2637c8d36180fcdd162be45ef7212bf", "ja": "もちろんです！　まずは、脚力の特訓から。\nお仕事までには戻ってきますね～！", "zh": "那是当然！首先要进行腿部力量的特训。\n在工作开始前我会回来的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0354_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e85909eb608ac506d55a93cd427d1d9ed8ca995db8ff6766b3ced28fff4f7f5c", "ja": "待て、紗代子！　運動するなら、\nレッスンウェアに着替えてからにしてくれ～！", "zh": "等一下，纱代子！要运动的话，\n至少先换成练习服再去啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
